{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hack n Slash action adventure game with manga inspired graphics. Explore a dense, interconnected, sci-fi, world rendered in a distinct graphical style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what we have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >24 distinct enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a unique combination of scripted and randomized arena battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 bosses\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a variety of player Skills and passives to experiment with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative integrally connected to the core combat gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 main weapon class with a 5 hit combo,\u00a0 different , slot-able, combo enders, other special contextual moves.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 3 secondary weapon classes, each with a 3 hit combo and a unique weapon skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cool stylish graphics ;)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >what we don't have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dial a combo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lots of cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >voice over</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708620/extras/a5ded0b79b1e07331d832d19b46b8121.poster.avif?t=1767634709\" width=780 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708620/extras/a5ded0b79b1e07331d832d19b46b8121.webm?t=1767634709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2708620/extras/a5ded0b79b1e07331d832d19b46b8121.mp4?t=1767634709\" type=\"